# Ketra and Varka soldiers (KetraOrcSupport, VarkaSilenosSupport) and a Ketra ally of level 1 who
# casts Detect Insect Weakness (75, a self buff of 303 aggro points) beside them: the Ketra footman
# sees it and wants to petrify the ally (Raid Curse, 4515); the Varka recruit, whose side the ally
# is not allied with, wants nothing. The footman then petrifies the ally. Each soldier lists the
# curse, which a scenario monster needs to cast it. The cast of a summon is in
# tests/quest/alliance_support_test.go. The footman's combat draws are pinned so the curse lands.
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (onSeeSpell).
character Ally 40
standing 1
skill 75 1
script script.feature.KetraOrcSupport
script script.feature.VarkaSilenosSupport
npc footman 21324 Monster 40 0 0 skill DEBUFF 4515 1
roll footman 0
npc recruit 21350 Monster -40 0 0 skill DEBUFF 4515 1

cast footman 75
  S MagicSkillUse caster=player target=player skill=75-1 hit=1958 reuse=13058 success=0
  S SystemMessage id=46 4:75,1
  S SystemMessage id=110 4:75,1
  desires footman cast(player,4515,move)=1000000
  desires recruit -
tick x3
  S MagicSkillUse caster=footman target=player skill=4515-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  S SystemMessage id=110 4:4515,1
